// rok::core tier (foundation) - safe, target-independent.
// Owns: List, Dict, Set, Tuple, Int, Float, ops, iter, sync (Atomic/Mutex),
//       task, time (Duration, Instant), par, fmt, reflect, future,
//       crypto (algorithms), encoding, io (byte streams, stdio).
// Bootstraps operator dispatch (`#[infix]`, `#[prefix]`, `#[postfix]`) and
// literal handlers (`#[literal]`).
// User code gets an implicit `use rok::core::prelude::*;` (stdlib spec
// 0.2); the library's own modules see all of `rok::core::**`.

